From 3748c4d5622663e0ce1925dbb203b19f01e47f59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 10:30:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Fix legacy CeylonX/theceylonx references in server code;
 corrected social/PWA hygiene pass (no font changes)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Server-side: fix real functional risks from the old domain/brand — CORS
allow-list now includes hibowan.com, OAuth callback URL fallbacks,
JWT issuer, transactional email/SMS copy and sender domain, admin
permission registry header, log/alert service names, redirect-URL
validator defaults, and dev seed data emails/names.

Client-side: rebuild the social-share/PWA hygiene pass (favicon set,
apple-touch-icon, PWA icon set, manifest.json, index.html meta tags,
SEO.tsx og:image) pointing at the new hero photo and hibowan.com,
without touching the site's live font (Inter stays as-is per explicit
instruction).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
